# Apex 26 — Cursor entry

- **Rules:** read root `AGENTS.md` (canonical). Root `CLAUDE.md` is a stub that
  imports it; do not edit rules into `CLAUDE.md`. Fleet rules:
  `.claude/rules/fleet-core.md` (always-on; generated twin
  `.cursor/rules/fleet-core.mdc`). Path-scoped rules: edit `.claude/rules/*.md`,
  then `npm run gen` (never hand-edit the generated `.mdc` twins).
- **Skills / subagents:** `.claude/skills/*/SKILL.md` and `.claude/agents/*.md`
  (shared with Claude Code). Codex via `.agents/skills/<name>`
  (`bash tools/env/mirror-skills.sh`) — keep lockstep, never fork. Do not add
  `.cursor/skills/` or `.cursor/agents/` unless Cursor-only.
- **Route:** deploy/`version.json` → `deploy-research` (host fetch / WebFetch);
  pre-push → `verify-agent` (`--base <ref>` for "was it already red?");
  live canvas → `mcp-probe`; host browser → `playwright-official`;
  bloat/extract/dead code → `slim-bloat` / `bloat-auditor`. Do not attach
  `mcp-probe` for a version.json check.
- **MCP:** three servers in root `.mcp.json` (and `.cursor/mcp.json`):
  `apex-tools`, `playwright-official`, `chrome-devtools`. Cloud host catalog
  often does **not** auto-load them — then `tools/mcp/apex-tools-mcp.sh call`,
  `tools/mcp/chrome-devtools-mcp.sh`, `python3 tools/mcp/probe-mcp.py chrome-start`
  (CLI daemon, not attached). `tools/mcp/tinyfish-mcp.sh` is CLI-only and
  egress-blocked in-container. Map: `docs/AGENT-SURFACE.md`.
- **Cursor Cloud:** launch with model id `default` only. Cloud MCP is always
  `cursor` / `cursor-cloud` / `cursor-subscriptions`, plus `apex-tools` /
  `chrome-devtools` / `playwright-official` after Bootstrap §3; if only the
  three `cursor*` appear, use the CLI fallbacks above, invent no namespace, and
  re-Save when `environment-info` shows nameless bare-`bash` allowlist rows.
  After every PR push: `subscribe_github_ci` + `subscribe_github_pr`; one timer
  check-in (~1 h) only if the host lists `subscribe_timer` / `send_later`.
  Serve locally for browser checks. AGENTS.md and the skills win.
- **Token hygiene:** one skill per task; prefer `__apex` / `verify-track` /
  `test:tooling-fast` before screenshots or browser groups. Bootstrap / Cloud
  MCP: `docs/AGENT-SURFACE.md` §Bootstrap.
